This product is a Rust port of software and uses models created by others.
All of the speech models, their training, the inference design and the
reference implementation are the work of their authors; this project only
re-implements the inference code in Rust.

VieNeu-TTS — https://github.com/pnnbao97/VieNeu-TTS
  Copyright Phạm Nguyễn Ngọc Bảo (pnnbao97), licensed under the Apache
  License 2.0. The code in src/ is a port of its ONNX inference engines
  (src/vieneu/_v3_turbo_engine/onnx_runtime_lite.py, src/vieneu/v3nano.py)
  and helpers from src/vieneu_utils/ (phonemize_text.py, core_utils.py,
  _v3_turbo_engine/rep_history.py), rewritten in Rust and adapted: the
  sentence chunking is simplified to one sentence at a time and audio
  watermarking is not applied. The preset voices (assets/voices_v3_*.json)
  are downloaded from that repository at run time, not redistributed.
  Models: https://huggingface.co/pnnbao-ump/VieNeu-TTS-v3-Turbo and
  https://huggingface.co/pnnbao-ump/VieNeu-TTS-v3-Nano (Apache-2.0),
  downloaded from Hugging Face at run time, not redistributed.

sea-g2p — https://github.com/pnnbao97/sea-g2p
  Copyright Phạm Nguyễn Ngọc Bảo (pnnbao97), licensed under the Apache
  License 2.0. Used as a library (its Rust crate); its dictionary
  sea_g2p.bin is downloaded from that repository at run time.

MOSS Audio Tokenizer Nano — https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Audio-Tokenizer-Nano-ONNX
  By OpenMOSS-Team, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The ONNX codec
  decoder is downloaded from Hugging Face at run time, not redistributed.
